### Invalidate region (force re-fetch and re-process)
POST http://localhost:8080/orch/api/regions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/invalidate

### Invalidate region (localhost) - Example UUID
# POST http://localhost:8081/orch/api/regions/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/invalidate

### Expected response:
# {
#   "region_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
#   "new_status": "Invalidated",  // or "NotStarted" if no batch existed
#   "detail": "Batch abc123... reset to collecting status for reprocessing"
# }
